      "content": "thanks. one thing though, the professor is worried about the actual language used in the book. there's some pretty intense racial slurs and stuff throughout the text. i was wondering if you could explain why conrad chose to use that kind of language instead of just describing the characters normally? is it just because that was how people talked back then, or is there something more to it?",
